WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
Next, which cloud.

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:06.697
The workbook's estate is a Microsoft
365 GCC tenant with commercial Azure,

3
00:00:06.697 --> 00:00:12.501
so the Azure CLI is set to Azure Cloud and
Resource Manager is the commercial host.

4
00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:16.744
Learn's sample queries for Service
Health each link to the Azure portal,

5
00:00:16.744 --> 00:00:20.700
and every record's source link is
the event on that commercial host.

6
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:25.646
The kit never guesses: the settings
name the cloud, an unknown name throws,

7
00:00:25.646 --> 00:00:29.500
and the live run refuses a CLI
that's set to another cloud.
